+ * unverified. This build is for UART, pstore, eMMC and USB bring-up.
+ */
+
+/* Secondary CPUs are broken on this platform due to firmware issues (same as doogee-x5pro) */
+/delete-node/ &cpu1;
+/delete-node/ &cpu2;
+/delete-node/ &cpu3;
